{"id":"4433970","name":"J.J. McCarthy","team":"NYG","pos":"QB","grp":"QB","num":"","head":"https://a.espncdn.com/i/headshots/nfl/players/full/4433970.png","age":23,"exp":"3","college":"Michigan","draft":["2024","1","10"],"depth":{"pos":"QB","rank":2,"unit":"3WR 1TE","team":"NYG"},"inj":{"status":"Active","note":"McCarthy looks set to make his first start of the season and his first as a member of the Giants after an impressive showing in relief of the struggling Jameis Winston during Sunday's 34-27 loss to New Orleans. After checking into the game with the Giants down 24 points with just under 12 minutes remaining in the fourth quarter, McCarthy proceeded to lead a furious comeback bid. He completed 11 of 21 passes for 243 yards, one touchdown and one interception in less than a quarter of action, leading the Giants into the red zone for a potential game-tying score in the final minute before an incompletion on a fourth-and-1 play sealed the win for the Saints. With franchise signal-caller Jaxson Dart (knee) likely lost for the season, the Giants could be motivated to give an extended look at the 23-year-old McCarthy to see if he can emerge as a viable long-term backup option or a potential trade chip down the road.","date":"2026-10-21T16:12Z","detail":""},"next":{"opp":"HOU","home":false,"date":"2026-10-25T17:00Z"},"dvp":{"r":26,"td":2.0,"yds":272.3,"n":32,"g":6},"news":[{"h":"Jameis Winston vs. J.J. McCarthy: Pros and cons of Giants' QBs","d":"Coach John Harbaugh must weigh the options in his QB conundrum, with two players who could start at Houston.","t":"2026-10-20T13:11:26Z"},{"h":"McCarthy nearly rallies Giants after Winston benched; Skattebo logs no carries","d":"Giants coach John Harbaugh said Sunday he's not ready to name a starting quarterback for Week 7 after J.J. McCarthy replaced Jameis Winston against the Saints.","t":"2026-10-19T02:14:56Z"}],"log":[{"s":2026,"w":6,"o":"NO","t":"NYG","g":"2026_06_NO_NYG","completions":11.0,"attempts":21.0,"passing_yard